      "w": 372,
      "h": 115
    },
    {
      "text": "Speed is the number one currency in business relationships. SPEED is more important than perfection. Too many opportunities are missed because a project took too long. A good plan executed now is bett",
      "fontFamily": "Generalsans, sans-serif",
