      "x": 755,
      "y": 1608,
      "w": 372,
      "h": 161
    },
    {
      "text": "Hold YOURSELF to a higher standard than anyone else would ask of you. Manage your own time and resources and OWN your decisions and outcomes as if this were your company. Make decisions that can make ",
      "fontFamily": "Generalsans, sans-serif",
