      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 755,
      "y": 2001,
      "w": 372,
      "h": 138
    },
    {
      "text": "Learn fast, fail fast, try again. That’s how you grow. You are either growing (making progress) or dying (stagnation/decline of progress) there is no in between. As a company, we are always ahead of t",
      "fontFamily": "Generalsans, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "500",
      "lineHeight": "23px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 755,
      "y": 2371,
      "w": 372,
      "h": 138
    },
    {
      "text": "Humility is keeping the business’ needs above your own. Humble people admit their deficits and grow. When making a decision, they are concerned with WHAT is right, not WHO is right. To have a business",
      "fontFamily": "Generalsans, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "500",
      "lineHeight": "23px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 755,
      "y": 2741,
      "w": 372,
      "h": 138
    },
    {
      "text": "Truth is best left untampered with. Someone else’s reaction to the truth is not your responsibility. When you sugar coat it, you serve no one by not giving people the opportunity to improve. Without i",
      "fontFamily": "Generalsans, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "16px",
